+## Routes
+
+- `POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`.
+  Quantities are positive whole portions; soldAt includes a timezone. Returns
+  `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`: new tickets and total portions imported.
+  All rows of a previously imported ticket are skipped. Invalid rows (including
+  rows on known tickets) or insufficient stock reject the entire file with a
+  `bad_request` message naming the row (header is row 1).
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+  `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, variance }`, sorted by item id. Days are UTC
+  and inclusive; `variance` is actual minus theoretical in the item's unit.
+  Actual includes every consume movement; theoretical uses ingredient quantities
+  saved with the sale. Only items with positive theoretical or actual use appear.
